ready_to_port.verdict:
Not ready as written. The interface itself held for eight languages, but four things would let six parallel ports ship false sentences unseen or collide on merge:
- the classification rules accept false facts automatically;
- the note lint is inert;
- the guard cannot read ocaml at all;
- the guard cannot check types in perl and ocaml.
Each is a small fix to make before porting starts.
